│     * **Keywords:** "centralized orchestration vs decentralized execution",  │
│  "hub-and-spoke multi-agent architecture", "peer-to-peer agent               │
│  communication", "topological communication efficiency", "scalable agent     │
│  coordination", "orchestrator agent performance"                             │
│     * **Synonyms:** "hierarchical vs flat agent topologies", "centralized    │
│  vs distributed multi-agent control"                                         │
│     * **Search angle:** Comparison / Experimental result                     │
│                                                                              │
│  5. **Sub-question (Limitations & Challenges):** What are the primary        │
│  failure modes, communication overheads, safety hazards, and                 │
│  synchronization bottlenecks that emerge during multi-agent communication?   │
│     * **Keywords:** "cascading hallucinations", "infinite message loops",    │
│  "communication bandwidth overhead", "coordination drift", "multi-agent      │
│  goal misalignment", "deadlock in agent negotiation"                         │
│     * **Synonyms:** "inter-agent communication bottlenecks", "multi-agent    │
│  system failure modes"                                                       │
│     * **Search angle:** Limitation                                           │
